# Guard film: up a pillar two blocks high, over its top and head first down the far side onto the floor, then away
# from it. Guards the climbing session's bugs: the gaster in the stone on top (docs/BUGS.md 34), the ant landing facing
# the wall at the foot of the climb down, the body not bridging the inside corner at the wall's foot.
cmd time set noon
cmd weather clear
cmd fill 3 -60 0 3 -59 0 stone
lens 30
walker worker_ant 0.5 -60 0.5 -90
log climb
cmd tick freeze
fov 10
follow 0 0.15 -7 0 0
go 3 -58 0
burst up 70 1
go 7 -60 0
burst down 70 1
log off
follow off
quit
